    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The Hermes-2700 spaceship, driven by a fearless pilot, Che goes in search of the planets for the life-giving civilization SAMS, Che's home planet was not suitable for life after the attack of the cruel empire \u201cPured\u201d<br><br>In Sams, you will have to control a spacecraft to destroy enemies, you can play alone or together with friends on one computer.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 6 unique planets<br></li><li> Single player game<br></li><li> cooperative mode<br></li><li> support for two keyboards or two gamepads</li></ul>",
